   "title": "How this works",
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "## 3 \u00b7 A shot\nEvery shot is made from the same pictures: **Picture 1** is the empty world plate (place, light, grade), **Picture 2** is the lead (face, hair, wardrobe) and **Picture 3** is the shot's storyboard drawing (composition and pose), plus the shot's action and camera.\n\nNo picture ever shows a second face, so the lead stays one person across the film."
   ],
